   "argument": "The sprint scope strictly limits proposals to at most 12 changes. Fulfilling the structural completeness, canonical ordering, exhaustive operation registry, complete attribute index, and splitting entity facets required by the other Critic mandates consumes the 12 allowed changes. Adding 8+ new distinct domain categories (travel, media, code, procedure, etc.) would exceed the limit. Because N2 remains open, these domain-specific categories will be introduced in the next sprint once this structural foundation is accepted."
  }
 ],
