   "membership_rule": "Lexical rules: IDENT is `[a-zA-Z_][a-zA-Z0-9_]*`. UNSIGNED_INT is `0` or `[1-9][0-9]*`. HEX is `[0-9a-fA-F]`. COMMENT is `#` to line end. ISO_DATE is `YYYY-MM-DD`. UTC_TIMESTAMP is `YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ssZ`. Whitespace (space, tab, newline) separates tokens but has no semantic meaning.",
