distinguishable from unrestricted IDENT formation."}, "improvement": {"impact": "benefit", "reasoning": "A weaker planner benefits from typed-looking search constraints, named code fields, explicit spatial relations, tone values, and artifact specifications. The benefit is limited where requirements remain buried in content strings, such as compatibility, a bug's reproduction program, or an open-ended generation brief."}}, "simulations": [{"item_id": "dev-embodied-2", "source": "seed_tasks", "nl": "Put both pillows from the sofa onto the armchair, one at a time.", "braincode": "ENTRYPOINT MovePillows\nTASK MovePillows {\n  ACTION pick_up(target=\"pillow\", source=\"sofa\") -> pillow : REF[STRING]\n  ACTION place(target=pillow, destination=\"armchair\", relation=on)\n  ACTION pick_up(target=\"pillow\", source=\"sofa\") -> pillow2 : REF[STRING]\n  ACTION place(target=pillow2, destination=\"armchair\", relation=on)\n}", "coverage": "Full", "notes": "The revised pick_up/place signatures and spatial-relation category help. Sequential duplication represents 'one at a time'; no quantity category is needed for this finite two-item request."}, {"item_id": "dev-email-2", "source": "seed_tasks", "nl": "If my manager hasn't replied by Friday, send a polite follow-up; otherwise do nothing.", "braincode": "ENTRYPOINT FollowUp\nTASK FollowUp CONTEXT execution_date=\"2025-06-03\" {\n  ACTION check_replied(target=\"manager\", deadline=\"2025-06-06T23:59:59Z\") -> replied : BOOL\n  IF NOT replied THEN {\n    ACTION send_email(recipient=manager, content=\"follow-up\", tone=polite)\n  }\n}", "coverage": "Full", "notes": "role-recipient, tone-value, and the corrected UTC_TIMESTAMP deadline improve the representation. The follow-up's substantive wording remains deliberately available through transitional content."}, {"item_id": "e344b89e-767a-4618-ba82-4b81cdcba280", "source": "Mind2Web (osunlp/Mind2Web, train, Parquet column-projected sample)", "nl": "add a motherboard under $200 and a 