n of whether marriage is important\") -> response : STRING\n  RETURN response\n}", "coverage": "Partial", "notes": "The artifact target and balanced style are available, but the topic and evaluative question are opaque content."}, {"item_id": "wildchat1m_en3u-129421", "source": "PATHs (microsoft/prototypical-hai-collaborations)", "nl": "Act as the collective persona Mark and explain in depth, casually and with concrete examples, how linear algebra converts text for ChatGPT-4 and converts model representations back into answers.", "braincode": "ENTRYPOINT ExplainLLMMath\nTASK ExplainLLMMath : STRING {\n  GENERATE(target=technical_introduction, audience_role=user, content=\"persona Mark; explain in depth how linear algebra encodes text for ChatGPT-4 and decodes answers; include concrete examples\", locale=en_us, style=detailed, tone=casual) -> explanation : STRING\n  RETURN explanation\n}", "coverage": "Partial", "notes": "technical_introduction, detailed, casual, and locale improve meta-structure. Persona composition, technical subject matter, and example requirements remain prose."}, {"item_id": "wildchat1m_en3u-148973", "source": "PATHs (microsoft/prototypical-hai-collaborations)", "nl": "Write a hilarious 17+ Scooby gang script mocking badly translated sentences and their inconsistencies.", "braincode": "ENTRYPOINT GenerateComedyScript\nTASK GenerateComedyScript : STRING {\n  GENERATE(target=scene, content=\"Scooby gang and Scrappy-Doo react to badly translated sentences; hilarious comedy; adult audience\") -> script : STRING\n  RETURN script\n}", "coverage": "Partial", "notes": "scene identifies a narrative artifact, but screenplay structure, named characters, comedy, age rating, translation-error premise, and recurring reaction constraints lack categories."}, {"item_id": "wildchat1m_en3u-142592", "source": "PATHs (microsoft/prototypical-hai-collaborations)", "nl": "Please write steps for homiletics and engaging Christian sermons.", "braincode": "ENTRYPOINT Gener