st is a structured academic/software planning task, not merely prose generation. No academic goal, CRUD requirement, framework, app-entity, or job-search-project category exists."}, {"item_id": "1775448065619", "source": "ThoughtTrace (SCAI-JHU/ThoughtTrace)", "nl": "I want a simple 3-day high-protein meal-prep plan with breakfast, lunch, and dinner.", "braincode": "ENTRYPOINT PlanMealPrep\nTASK PlanMealPrep : STRING {\n  GENERATE(target=plan, content=\"simple high-protein meal prep for 3 days with breakfast lunch and dinner\") -> meal_plan : STRING\n  RETURN meal_plan\n}", "coverage": "Partial", "notes": "plan is applicable, but meal, diet, nutrition, day, meal-slot, and high-protein criteria lack categories."}, {"item_id": "1775760283577", "source": "ThoughtTrace (SCAI-JHU/ThoughtTrace)", "nl": "Explain end-stage heart failure in a way a 5-year-old can understand.", "braincode": "ENTRYPOINT ExplainHeartFailure\nTASK ExplainHeartFailure : STRING {\n  GENERATE(target=technical_introduction, audience_role=user, content=\"simple child-appropriate explanation of end-stage heart failure for a 5-year-old\", tone=empathetic) -> explanation : STRING\n  RETURN explanation\n}", "coverage": "Partial", "notes": "technical_introduction and empathetic tone help, but medical topic, child audience age, simplification level, and prognosis/safety context remain prose."}]
