      ],
      "membership_rule": "Each member belongs to exactly one facet: artifact target, format, style, locale, or duration unit. When a symbol (e.g., detailed) exists in multiple categories, it is resolved by the attribute's expected category.",
      "worked_example": {
        "nl": "Write a balanced structured report for a two-week project.",
