   "change": "Add the deferred missing categories identified by the simulations: itinerary/day/stop/route and travel-time; transit stop-count and policy/amenity; media venue/showtime/ticket/seat; typed compatibility/instrument relations; code file/method/property/call/assertion and expected-versus-actual behavior; revision/improvement; procedure/safety/escalation; academic/job-search goals; food/nutrition/meal structures; medical topic/audience constraints; and email/message/collaboration structures.",
   "argument": "I am complying with the instruction not to characterize the vocabulary as exhaustive. I have removed 'complete' and 'exhaustive' claims from the glosses. Because of the strict 12-change limit per sprint, I am staging the addition of these remaining descriptive categories for the next sprint, focusing this sprint on solidifying the foundational structural, operational, and attribute rules required by the other Critic notes."
  }
 ],
