   "membership_rule": "Lexical rules: IDENT is `[a-zA-Z_][a-zA-Z0-9_]*` excluding reserved words. NUMBER is `-? [0-9]+ ( \\. [0-9]+ )? ( [eE] [+-]? [0-9]+ )?`. STRING is `\"` followed by any chars except unescaped `\"` and `\\`, escaping with `\\\"`, `\\\\`, `\\n`, `\\t`, `\\uXXXX`, closed by `\"`. COMMENT is `#` to line end. ISO_DATE is exactly `YYYY-MM-DD`. UTC_TIMESTAMP is `YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ssZ`. Whitespace separates tokens.",
   "worked_example": {
    "nl": "If 5 is greater than 3, return 1.",
    "braincode": "ENTRYPOINT IfGreater\nTASK IfGreater : NUMBER {\n  LET one : NUMBER = 1\n  IF 5 > 3 THEN {\n    RETURN one\n  }\n  LET zero : NUMBER = 0\n  RETURN zero\n}"
   },
   "change_type": "MAJOR",
   "rationale": "Completes the structural word inventory and exact lexical rules as required, including NUMBER, STRING, diff '-', and reserved word exclusion.",
