writing.\n\n4. Cancellation Policy:\n   a. In the event that circumstances outside of your control require the event to be canceled, I am willing to work with you to reschedule the speaking engagement for a later date, subject to our mutual availability.\n   b. If you must cancel the event due to reasons beyond my control, I kindly request reimbursement for any already incurred expenses.\n\n5. Right to Record and Use:\n   a. With your permission, I may record, stream, or capture photographs during my presentation for promotional, marketing, and archival purposes.\n   b. I kindly request your consent to use my name, likeness, voice, and any associated content from the event for promotional purposes related to my activities.\n\n6. Confidentiality and Non-Disclosure:\n   a. We agree to maintain the confidentiality of any proprietary or sensitive information exchanged between us regarding this agreement or the event.\n   b. I assure you that I will not disclose, discuss, or make use of any information gained during the event, except as necessary for the success of the engagement.\n\n7. Governing Law and Jurisdiction:\n   a. This agreement shall be governed by and construed under the laws of [State/Country].\n   b. Any disputes arising out of or relating to this agreement shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the courts in [State/Country].\n\nPlease carefully review the terms and conditions outlined above. If you agree to proceed with this agreement, kindly indicate your acceptance by signing and returning a copy of this document no later than [Date]. If you require any clarification or have additional questions, please do not hesitate to contact me.\n\nThank you for considering my services as a high-demand speaker for your event. I am eager to collaborate with you and contribute to the success of your program. I look forward to our partnership and a remarkable event.\n\nWarm regards,\n\n[Your Name]\n[Your Title/Position]\n[Your Website/Bio Link]",
