oolean true literal.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "FALSE", "gloss": "Boolean false literal.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "SPEAKER", "gloss": "Speaker label.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "USER", "gloss": "User speaker.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "AGENT", "gloss": "Agent speaker.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "REPLY_TO", "gloss": "Turn adjacency.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "REVISES", "gloss": "Turn correction.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "DECREASES", "gloss": "Recursion guard.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "CONTEXT", "gloss": "Task context.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "AND", "gloss": "Logical AND.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "OR", "gloss": "Logical OR.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "NOT", "gloss": "Logical NOT.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "{", "gloss": "Block start.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "}", "gloss": "Block end.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "(", "gloss": "Paren start.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": ")", "gloss": "Paren end.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "[", "gloss": "Bracket start.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "]", "gloss": "Bracket end.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": ",", "gloss": "Separator.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": ":", "gloss": "Type annotator.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "=", "gloss": "Assignment.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "->", "gloss": "Result bind.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "==", "gloss": "Equality.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "!=", "gloss": "Inequality.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "<", "gloss": "Less-than.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "<=", "gloss": "Less-or-equal.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": ">", "gloss": "Greater-than.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": ">=", "gloss": "Greater-or-equal.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "-", "gloss": "Arithmetic difference.", "nl_synonyms": []}], "membership_rule": "Lexical rules: IDENT is `[a-zA-Z_][a-zA-Z0-9_]*` excluding reserved words. NUMBER is `-? [0-9]+ ( \\. [0-9]+ )? ( [eE] [+-]? [0-9]+ )?`. STRING is `\"` followed by any chars except unescaped `\"` and `\\`, escaping with `\\\"`, `\\\\`, `\\n`, `\\t`, `\\uXXXX`, closed by `\"`. COMMENT is `#` to line end. ISO_DATE is exactly `YYYY-MM-DD`. UTC_TIMESTAMP is `YYYY-MM-DDThh:mm:ssZ`. Whitespace separates tokens.", "worked_example": {"nl": "If 5 is greater than 3, return 1.", "braincode": "ENTRYPOINT IfGreater\nTASK IfGreater : NUMBER {\n  LET one : NUMBER = 1\n  IF 5 > 3 THEN {\n    RETURN one\n  }\n  LET zero : NUMBER = 0\n  RETURN zero\n}"}, "change_type": "MAJOR", "rationale": "Completes the structural word inventory and exact lexical rules as required, including NUMBER, STRING, diff '-', and reserved word exclusion.", "addresses_note": "N2"}, {"op": "add", "kind": "vocabulary", "construct_name": "operation-vocabulary", "glossary_gloss": "The initial index of normative Action and UTTER operations. Not exhaustive; missing domains will be added.", "closed": false, "members": [{"symbol": "open_page", "gloss": "Navigate to a page.", "nl_synonyms": ["go to"]}, {"symbol": "click", "gloss": "Click an element.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "select_filter", "gloss": "Apply one filter.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "apply_filters", "gloss": "Apply multiple filters.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "sort", "gloss": "Rank a list.", "nl_synonyms": ["rank", "order by"]}, {"symbol": "search_travel", "gloss": "Search travel.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "search_transit", "gloss": "Search transit.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "search_web", "gloss": "Search the web.", "nl_synonyms": ["find", "look for"]}, {"symbol": "fill_field", "gloss": "Fill a form field.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "submit", "gloss": "Submit a form.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "extract", "gloss": "Select members of a list.", "nl_synonyms": ["select"]}, {"symbol": "read_page", "gloss": "Read page content.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "save_favorite", "gloss": "Save to favorites.", "nl_synonyms": []}, {"symbol": "add_to_cart",