- `distance` — Search distance.
- `min_rating` — Minimum rating.
- `max_price` — Maximum price.
- `currency` — Price currency.
- `genre` — Search genre.
- `category` — Search category.
- `availability` — Search stock.
- `rank_field` — Sort field.
- `rank_direction` — Sort direction.
- `limit` — Extract member count.
- `deadline` — Reply deadline.
- `metric` — Support metric.
- `platform` — Platform constraint.
