   "model (claude-2, score=39): I don't have enough context to judge if it's okay to back out. Consider having an open, compassionate talk with grandma about your relationship. If that's not possible, attend briefly to support your family, but don't force yourself into an unpleasant situation all day. Be respectful and set boundaries if needed.",
